<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian bond market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Australian bond market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian bond market is closed today for Queen's Birthday  holiday.</p>
<p>The 10-year bond yield closed at around 7.33 percent on Friday as offshore demand and booksquaring ahead of the long holiday weekend triggered a short squeeze in the futures market.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
